@@title SQ-ENC Enchanted books out of villager trades, 2026-11-20 ([brief](../briefs/potions_enchanting.md) enchanting #1, TODO `potions/enchanting #1`)
@@date 2026-11-20
@@jars creativecommon
@@sources kubejs/server_scripts/economy/trades.js config/trades/lightmanscurrency/custom_cashier_trades.json config/trades/lightmanscurrency/custom_banker_trades.json config/quark-common.toml feature_writeup/briefs/potions_enchanting.md
@@text
@@text `trades.js` drops vanilla's `EnchantBookForEmeralds` (all professions, so Dynamic Villager Trades and MCA too) and
@@text Domestication Innovation's Charisma book; Lightman's Currency cashier books and banker Money Mending books are out of
@@text `config/trades/lightmanscurrency/`; Quark `Librarians Exchange Ancient Tomes` = false. Full restart (Quark config and
@@text the LC trade files are read at start). Already-spawned villagers keep their offers (D6), so test fresh villagers.
