@@table
## SQ-ENC-03 | no enchanted book or tome exchange in any profession's trade table
@group any
@commands boot; `/dumptrades`; search every profession in `kubejs/exported/villager_trades.json` for `minecraft:enchanted_book` and `quark:ancient_tome`; `logs/kubejs/server.log` (or `latest.log`) for the trades.js count line
@pass 0 hits for both ids in `professions`; the log has `[trades] enchanted book listings removed: N` with N at least 6 (librarian levels 1 to 5 plus the animal tamer); paper, bookshelf, compass, clock still in the librarian table
@fails `trades.js` removal block (class names: `VillagerTrades$EnchantBookForEmeralds`, DI `SellingEnchantedBook`); LC hits: `config/trades/lightmanscurrency/*.json` reset by the mod (compare with `configs_edited/root_config/trades/`); tome hit: `quark-common.toml` "Librarians Exchange Ancient Tomes"
> dumptrades
sleep 5
shell grep -hoE "\[trades\] enchanted book listings removed: [0-9]+" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log | tail -1
shell python3 -c "import json,sys;p=json.load(open('kubejs/exported/villager_trades.json'))['professions'];bad=[(k,x) for k,v in p.items() for x in ('minecraft:enchanted_book','quark:ancient_tome') if x in json.dumps(v)];print('hits',bad);lib=json.dumps(p.get('minecraft:librarian'));print('librarian keeps',[x for x in ('minecraft:paper','minecraft:bookshelf','minecraft:compass','minecraft:clock') if x in lib]);sys.exit(1 if bad else 0)"
look the shell line: hits [] and the librarian keeps its four items

## SQ-ENC-04 | a fresh librarian at every level offers no book
@group B
@commands summon a librarian with a lectern (NoAI), step `VillagerData.level` 1 to 5 with offers reset; read `Offers`
@pass no offer at any level has `minecraft:enchanted_book` as its result or cost; at level 5 no `quark:ancient_tome` offer
@fails Dynamic Villager Trades builds librarian books from the vanilla listing (brief enchanting #1 Now): the removal in `trades.js` did not reach `VillagerTrades.TRADES`, or DVT cached offers (restart)
> forceload add -16 -16 16 16
> setblock 2 100 2 minecraft:lectern
> setblock 2 99 3 minecraft:stone
> summon minecraft:villager 2 100 3 {VillagerData:{profession:"minecraft:librarian",level:1,type:"minecraft:plains"},NoAI:1b,Tags:["enc4"]}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[tag=enc4,limit=1] Offers
> data merge entity @e[tag=enc4,limit=1] {VillagerData:{level:3},Offers:{}}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[tag=enc4,limit=1] Offers
> data merge entity @e[tag=enc4,limit=1] {VillagerData:{level:5},Offers:{}}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[tag=enc4,limit=1] Offers
reject minecraft:enchanted_book
reject quark:ancient_tome
look Offers may stay empty after a reset until a level-up refill: then record that and lean on SQ-ENC-03 (the table the refill draws from)
